## Redis namespaces

We share one Redis instance. Prefixes are assigned in `docs/redis-namespaces.md`. The ones that touch ingestion:

- `cb:` — circuit breaker state (mine, used by your fetcher via the class above)
- `q:` — the work queue

Don't write unprefixed keys, and never run `KEYS *` or `FLUSHDB`.

